ot/pull/109401.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-23T02:01:28Z"},"body":"When working on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90400 originally, it was deemed that it wouldn't be necessary to use the ubershader on the Material and SDF variants. However, after that PR, some specialization constants (e.g. multimesh) were added to Forward+ that do directly affect these variants, but their ubershaders weren't created. This can lead to situations where it can compile pipelines at draw time if multimesh is enabled.\r\n\r\nAs we currently deem that situation an [error that must be fixed](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/performance/pipeline_compilations.html#pipeline-precompilation-monitors), this PR was made to address it.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109401/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109401/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null